  "given_answer": "\\(-a+b+1\\)",
  "answer": "\\(-a+b+1\\)",
  "given_solution": "【分析】本题主要考查数轴、绝对值和去括号，根据\\(\\left | { a-b } \\right |=-\\left ( { a-b } \\right )=-a+b\\)和\\(\\left | { b } \\right |=b\\)，即可求得答案．\n【详解】解：∵\\(a-b < 0\\)，\\(b>0\\)，\n∴\\(\\left | { a-b } \\right |=-\\left ( { a-b } \\right )=-a+b\\)．\n∵\\(b>0\\)，\n∴\\(\\left | { b } \\right |=b\\)．\n∴\\(\\frac { |b| } { b }=\\frac { b } { b }=1\\)．\n∴\\(\\left | { a-b } \\right |+\\frac { \\left | { b } \\right | } { b }=-a+b+1\\)．\n故答案为：\\(-a+b+1\\)．",
  "given_solution_figures": [
    "assets/figures/43/4385c1452fcd9273cc21081a93692f92d01814654d98c674dab03845d888e004.png"
  ],
